    misreading: "Do not read al-Hasan's answer as making fame harmless. He and the others in this section ran from being followed. His answer only says whom the report is aimed at most.",
    reflection: "Notice the next time you do something partly because it will be noticed. Ask what you would do if no one could notice it.",
